## SRX-1 — policies added for the lab.
## default-deny already existed on the device and is intentionally not included here.
set security zones security-zone trust address-book address LAN-A 192.168.10.0/24
set security zones security-zone untrust address-book address LAN-B 192.168.20.0/24
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy default-permit match source-address any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy default-permit match destination-address any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy default-permit match application any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy default-permit then permit
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy LAN-A-TO-LAN-B match source-address LAN-A
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy LAN-A-TO-LAN-B match destination-address LAN-B
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy LAN-A-TO-LAN-B match application any
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy LAN-A-TO-LAN-B then permit
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy LAN-B-TO-LAN-A match source-address LAN-B
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy LAN-B-TO-LAN-A match destination-address LAN-A
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy LAN-B-TO-LAN-A match application any
set security policies from-zone untrust to-zone trust policy LAN-B-TO-LAN-A then permit
